HerdrOid

HerdrOid is an unofficial, third-party Android client for a machine running
herdr-core (hc). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the herdr project.

The launcher icon contains a derivative of the Android robot mascot,
reproduced from work created and shared by Google and used according to the
terms described in the Creative Commons 3.0 Attribution License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). The ram horns, terminal
prompt face, and color scheme are original HerdrOid artwork.
